                <pb facs="0910" n="840" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg840"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 218.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wallace to Bev. Mr. Pettibone.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-05-11"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 11,
                        1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Sir</hi>: I inclose a copy of a communication
                    received yesterday from the Porte relating to reprinting the Bible and
                    Testament. Be good enough to submit it to the brethren interested, and give me a
                    report of their wishes, the question being whether or not to accept the
                    authorization, with the condition attached.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>LEW. WALLACE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
